    },
    {
      "id": "2Bs09wQEjrDko75av4ORu",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 330.05151613131113,
      "y": 37.624523707414085,
      "width": 1144,
      "height": 150,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aR",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1529270646,
      "version": 33,
      "versionNonce": 108726390,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780628399176,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "You're designing the webhook ingestion layer for TartanHQ. A payment partner (Razorpay/Stripe-style) \nsends webhooks(created by us) notifying us of payment status changes for transactions our merchants \ninitiated. #ingest notifs from webhook from diff gateways, capture the updated status\nWe're processing ~50 webhooks/second on average, with bursts to 500/second when a partner has been down \nand replays buffered events. \n#50 notifications/sec, incr to 500 /sec in case of reup",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "You're designing the webhook ingestion layer for TartanHQ. A payment partner (Razorpay/Stripe-style) \nsends webhooks(created by us) notifying us of payment status changes for transactions our merchants \ninitiated. #ingest notifs from webhook from diff gateways, capture the updated status\nWe're processing ~50 webhooks/second on average, with bursts to 500/second when a partner has been down \nand replays buffered events. \n#50 notifications/sec, incr to 500 /sec in case of reup",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "_Ys7I8GhwaRirnxTtU6WP",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 274.83852308444426,
      "y": 220.2502798342568,
      "width": 200.19992065429688,
      "height": 35,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aS",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1753706678,
      "version": 7,
      "versionNonce": 2029019626,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780628399176,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Requirements ",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Requirements ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "7wenJlFmrdHiyfq_UcUFZ",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 313.5347291745453,
      "y": 308.8195300860569,
      "width": 1298,
      "height": 275,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1e1e1e",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "aT",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1276498858,
      "version": 70,
      "versionNonce": 372148662,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780628399176,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. Acknowledge within 2 seconds or partner times out and retries.\n2. Partner retries 3–5 times on any non-2xx or timeout. Same event_id may arrive multiple times. Each event \n    processed exactly once. Downstream side effects (merchant ledger update, notification, settlement trigger) \n    must not duplicate.\n3. Out-of-order delivery. Partner does not guarantee order. payment.captured may arrive before payment.authorized.\n    Final state must be correct regardless.\n4. Signature verification via HMAC-SHA256, timing-safe.\n5. Replay protection — reject events older than 5 minutes via signed timestamp header.\n6. State machine: created → authorized → captured → settled, or created → failed, or {captured, settled} → \n    refunded. Invalid transitions rejected-but-ACKed.\n7. Side effects: captured → notification job. settled → reconciliation job. Exactly-once per (payment_id, event_type).",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. Acknowledge within 2 seconds or partner times out and retries.\n2. Partner retries 3–5 times on any non-2xx or timeout. Same event_id may arrive multiple times. Each event \n    processed exactly once. Downstream side effects (merchant ledger update, notification, settlement trigger) \n    must not duplicate.\n3. Out-of-order delivery. Partner does not guarantee order. payment.captured may arrive before payment.authorized.\n    Final state must be correct regardless.\n4. Signature verification via HMAC-SHA256, timing-safe.\n5. Replay protection — reject events older than 5 minutes via signed timestamp header.\n6. State machine: created → authorized → captured → settled, or created → failed, or {captured, settled} → \n    refunded. Invalid transitions rejected-but-ACKed.\n7. Side effects: captured → notification job. settled → reconciliation job. Exactly-once per (payment_id, event_type).",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "m7bWmosRw2DFYNJyaWL0p",
      "type": "text",
