      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780628399176,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Purpose:\nExactly-once side effects.\n\nid\npayment_id\nevent_type\nstatus\ncreated_at\nprocessed_at\n\nExample\n    pay_1\n    captured\n\nmeans:\n    notification needs to be sent\n\nImportant Constraint\n    UNIQUE(payment_id, event_type)\n\nExample:\n    (pay_1, captured)\n\ncan exist only once.\n\nThis prevents:\n    Notification sent twice\n    Settlement triggered twice",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Purpose:\nExactly-once side effects.\n\nid\npayment_id\nevent_type\nstatus\ncreated_at\nprocessed_at\n\nExample\n    pay_1\n    captured\n\nmeans:\n    notification needs to be sent\n\nImportant Constraint\n    UNIQUE(payment_id, event_type)\n\nExample:\n    (pay_1, captured)\n\ncan exist only once.\n\nThis prevents:\n    Notification sent twice\n    Settlement triggered twice",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
