    {
      "id": "quyCMzVDeToYVhIgnWw2x",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 106.58670648894298,
      "y": 7099.657338630851,
      "width": 528,
      "height": 1825,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "at",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 467214710,
      "version": 214,
      "versionNonce": 801641194,
      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780628399176,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Let's process a real request.\n\nWebhook:\n\n{\n  \"event_id\": \"evt_102\",\n  \"event_type\": \"payment.captured\",\n  \"payment\": {\n      \"payment_id\": \"pay_1\",\n      \"merchant_id\": \"mer_1\"\n  }\n}\n\nStep 1\n    Webhook API receives request.\n\nStep 2\n    Verify Signature\n    Header:\n\n    X-Partner-Signature\n\n    We compute:\n    HMAC(secret, payload)\n    Compare with received signature.\n    Use timing-safe comparison.\n\n    If mismatch:\n    401 Unauthorized\n\nStep 3\n    Verify Timestamp\n    Header:\n        X-Partner-Timestamp\n        Requirement:\n            CurrentTime - Timestamp <= 5 minutes\n\n        Otherwise:\n            Reject\n\n        This prevents replay attacks.\n\nStep 4\n    Insert into webhook_events\n        INSERT INTO webhook_events\n        (event_id,...)\n    \n    Suppose:\n        evt_102\n\n        already exists.\n        Unique constraint fails.\n        Means duplicate.\n        Return:\n            200 OK\n\n        No further processing.\n\n        If insert succeeds:\n            Event accepted\n\nStep 5\n    Publish Event To Kafka\n    payment_webhook_topic\n\nStep 6\n    Return ACK\n    200 OK\n    This happens quickly.\n\n    Within:\n        < 2 seconds\n",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Let's process a real request.\n\nWebhook:\n\n{\n  \"event_id\": \"evt_102\",\n  \"event_type\": \"payment.captured\",\n  \"payment\": {\n      \"payment_id\": \"pay_1\",\n      \"merchant_id\": \"mer_1\"\n  }\n}\n\nStep 1\n    Webhook API receives request.\n\nStep 2\n    Verify Signature\n    Header:\n\n    X-Partner-Signature\n\n    We compute:\n    HMAC(secret, payload)\n    Compare with received signature.\n    Use timing-safe comparison.\n\n    If mismatch:\n    401 Unauthorized\n\nStep 3\n    Verify Timestamp\n    Header:\n        X-Partner-Timestamp\n        Requirement:\n            CurrentTime - Timestamp <= 5 minutes\n\n        Otherwise:\n            Reject\n\n        This prevents replay attacks.\n\nStep 4\n    Insert into webhook_events\n        INSERT INTO webhook_events\n        (event_id,...)\n    \n    Suppose:\n        evt_102\n\n        already exists.\n        Unique constraint fails.\n        Means duplicate.\n        Return:\n            200 OK\n\n        No further processing.\n\n        If insert succeeds:\n            Event accepted\n\nStep 5\n    Publish Event To Kafka\n    payment_webhook_topic\n\nStep 6\n    Return ACK\n    200 OK\n    This happens quickly.\n\n    Within:\n        < 2 seconds\n",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
