      "isDeleted": true,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780628399176,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Worker consumes Kafka.\nReceives:\n    evt_102\n    payment.captured\n    pay_1\n\n    Load current state.\n        SELECT current_state\n        FROM payments\n        WHERE payment_id='pay_1'\n\n    Suppose:\n        authorized\n\n    Check transition.\n        authorized -> captured\n\n    Allowed?\n        Yes.\n\n    Update payment.\n        captured\n\n    Insert history row.\n        authorized\n             ↓\n        captured",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Worker consumes Kafka.\nReceives:\n    evt_102\n    payment.captured\n    pay_1\n\n    Load current state.\n        SELECT current_state\n        FROM payments\n        WHERE payment_id='pay_1'\n\n    Suppose:\n        authorized\n\n    Check transition.\n        authorized -> captured\n\n    Allowed?\n        Yes.\n\n    Update payment.\n        captured\n\n    Insert history row.\n        authorized\n             ↓\n        captured",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
