      "updated": 1780628399176,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Same DB transaction:\n    Update payment state\n    Insert history\n    Insert outbox event\n    Commit\n\nOutbox row:\n    pay_1\n    captured\n\nWhy same transaction?\nBecause:\nWe don't want:\n    Payment updated\n    Notification lost",
