      "locked": false,
      "text": "I am little confused on \n1.howmany and for which tasks we need workers \n2. Does Worker will consume Kafka?",
      "fontSize": 28,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
