    {
      "id": "-1jA2IuT-z6Rh4NXRPD0i",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -313.2791200084096,
      "y": 29435.73417990704,
      "width": 1122,
      "height": 125,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b0F",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 367866538,
      "version": 398,
      "versionNonce": 1887582838,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780629000359,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. first of all most of the time we dont require immediate delivery, but notification should never be \nlost(we should make sure that lost notifications should be minimised)\n2. 10M mails per day scale\n3. Availabiliry >> Consistency (our system is availalbe to send notifications) ,High availability is\n    important.",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. first of all most of the time we dont require immediate delivery, but notification should never be \nlost(we should make sure that lost notifications should be minimised)\n2. 10M mails per day scale\n3. Availabiliry >> Consistency (our system is availalbe to send notifications) ,High availability is\n    important.",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
