      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780638051560,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Webhook(api exposed for third party) -> ",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Webhook(api exposed for third party) -> ",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
    {
      "id": "GRru43IFfsaIc5Ga_jCgR",
      "type": "text",
      "x": -625.7650206673494,
      "y": 32619.87309916329,
      "width": 1375,
      "height": 475,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#1971c2",
      "backgroundColor": "#ffec99",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 2,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 0,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "index": "b1M",
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 501204458,
      "version": 2282,
      "versionNonce": 1794354550,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1780635033742,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "lets say we are building a system(website), and we want some third party system to communicate to our system.\n\nlets say we have integrated Razorpay as our Payment Gateway, so razorpay is a thirdparty for us. Lot of system\nuses Razorpay not only our system that uses Razorpay. What Razorpay says that I am a Payment gateway, my responsibility\nis to take payment details from you and communicate to the bank of the user and deduct the payment and deliver it\nto your account thats my responsibility. But me or Blinkit or Zomate need payment confirmation also, like dont\njust deduct the money in our behalf give us the payment confirmation as well that whether the payment was successful\nor not. Zomato also ask for confirmation, Swiggy also asks and we also ask for confirmation, now one way that they\ncan give us confirmation they can make complete flow synchronous, that we make sync call to Razorpay, we wait for\nRazorpay to do everything on their end, they block our user, and once everything is done they will revert us, that is\na bad thing due to our user might be block for long period of time.\nOn the other hadn we will just submit the request to razorpay, that hey Razorpay please do this payment, we will not\nblock Razorpay means we will not send sync request, we just know, razorpay has take payment details and now it is processsing\nwhen Razorpay has processed the request then what we need to do, Razorpay need to talk back to us, Now how razorpay will\ncommunicate with us. We need to register an API to Razorpay that whenever the payment confirmation happens, hit me on\nthis particular API call. and this API will be separately prepared by us with our own implementations.\n\nSo webhook is an API that we expose so that third party systems can communicate to us. these apis work is restricted they are\nthere so that third party can communicate to us. (33:20)",
      "fontSize": 20,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "lets say we are building a system(website), and we want some third party system to communicate to our system.\n\nlets say we have integrated Razorpay as our Payment Gateway, so razorpay is a thirdparty for us. Lot of system\nuses Razorpay not only our system that uses Razorpay. What Razorpay says that I am a Payment gateway, my responsibility\nis to take payment details from you and communicate to the bank of the user and deduct the payment and deliver it\nto your account thats my responsibility. But me or Blinkit or Zomate need payment confirmation also, like dont\njust deduct the money in our behalf give us the payment confirmation as well that whether the payment was successful\nor not. Zomato also ask for confirmation, Swiggy also asks and we also ask for confirmation, now one way that they\ncan give us confirmation they can make complete flow synchronous, that we make sync call to Razorpay, we wait for\nRazorpay to do everything on their end, they block our user, and once everything is done they will revert us, that is\na bad thing due to our user might be block for long period of time.\nOn the other hadn we will just submit the request to razorpay, that hey Razorpay please do this payment, we will not\nblock Razorpay means we will not send sync request, we just know, razorpay has take payment details and now it is processsing\nwhen Razorpay has processed the request then what we need to do, Razorpay need to talk back to us, Now how razorpay will\ncommunicate with us. We need to register an API to Razorpay that whenever the payment confirmation happens, hit me on\nthis particular API call. and this API will be separately prepared by us with our own implementations.\n\nSo webhook is an API that we expose so that third party systems can communicate to us. these apis work is restricted they are\nthere so that third party can communicate to us. (33:20)",
      "autoResize": true,
      "lineHeight": 1.25
    },
